Placeholder. CI populates this directory with a real, official Node.js
binary distribution (bin/node + its lib/ dependents) for the target
platform/arch before running `tauri build` — see
.github/workflows/build.yml's "Fetch portable Node runtime" step and
empyralis-gateway/src/update/desktop-node-version.ts for the pinned
version. This placeholder exists only so `cargo check`/`cargo build`
succeed in a plain checkout without requiring a real download.
